ed that nuclear weapons would be decisive in a general war but that other arms and weapons would continue to play a major role--a line both he and former Defense Minister Zhukov have expounded.\n\nThe [MASKED] delegation apparently learned nothing about the present state of the Soviet ICBM program, except that ICBMs were referred to in the present tense. It was stated that intermediate-range ballistic missiles now cover Western bases in Europe.","query_utf8_sha256":"35b2add958950caaa5c021c4c254b05398c04f943fe4804af15cf1357a8feddc","source_assessment":null,"task":"redaction"},{"assessments":[{"config":"llm_readings","native_checkpoint":{"path":"phase/demo_refinement_20261126/epochs/aung_v10_native_v1/refine_cib_r_burma_agreement_short_v1/native.json.gz","sha256":"db65766f4a4ab08e70f43caa421019c6b2f74580769db5e36f64d1a8205f479c"},"native_checksum":"0b2684873f43972331785c71236f4275fd8460140d5242a6966a6406456a9366","readings":[{"candidates":[{"fill":"Nu's","rank":1,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"General Ne Win's","rank":2,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"Brigadier Aung Gyi's","rank":3,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"President Bourguiba's","rank":4,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"Premier Debr\u00e9's","rank":5,"status":"exploratory_contextual"}],"reading_id":"next_reading_9c5c331baa6d82da17e72ee3"},{"candidates":[{"fill":"military","rank":1,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"Chinese","rank":2,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"Communist","rank":3,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"Burmese","rank":4,"status":"exploratory_contextual"},{"fill":"determined","rank":5,"status":"exploratory_contextual"}],"reading_id":"next_reading_104b5cd28e0dc830525af9e3"},{"candidates":[],"reading_id":"next_reading_7212a58fd2cd2dfb52f81845"}],"status":"CANDIDATE_SUGGESTIONS"}],"case_id":"refine_cib_r_burma_agreement_short_v1","corpus":"cib","date":"1960-12-28","document_id":"CIA-RDP79T00975A005400500001-6","origin_refs